        "text_xtPwwF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At AstroAura.market (operated by Stratnova Technologies LLC, India), we are committed to providing you with a seamless shopping experience — from the moment you place your order to the time it reaches your doorstep. We deliver products both within India and internationally, in partnership with trusted courier and logistics providers.</p><h2>Delivery Timelines</h2><p><br/>Domestic (within India): Orders are typically delivered within 4–7 business days from the date of dispatch.<br/>International (outside India): Orders may take between 10–20 business days, depending on the destination country, courier efficiency, and customs regulations.<br/>Kindly note: Unexpected factors such as weather conditions, strikes, public holidays, or customs clearance may occasionally extend delivery timelines.</p><h2>Order Processing & Dispatch</h2><p><br/>All confirmed orders are processed within 1–3 business days.<br/>Once dispatched, customers will receive a confirmation email or SMS with the tracking number and courier details.<br/>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next working day.</p><h2>Tracking Your Order</h2><p><br/>Each shipment is assigned a unique tracking number at the time of dispatch.<br/>Customers may track their orders in real time through the courier’s website or the link shared by us.<br/>Our support team is always available to assist with tracking-related queries.</p><h2>Packaging & Shipping Assurance</h2><p><br/>Every product is carefully packed to ensure it reaches you in perfect condition.<br/>Fragile and delicate items are given special protective packaging.<br/>In the rare event of transit damage, customers may initiate a return or replacement request in accordance with our Returns & Replacement Policy.</p><h2>Customs, Duties & Taxes (International Orders)</h2><p><br/>For international deliveries, customs duties, import taxes, or additional charges (if applicable) are determined by the laws of the destination country.<br/>These charges are not included in the product price or shipping fee and must be paid by the customer.<br/>While AstroAura.market cannot influence customs clearance timelines, we will provide all required documentation to assist in the process.<br/></p><h2>Important Notes</h2><p><br/>Deliveries are made to the shipping address provided at checkout. Please ensure all details are accurate to avoid delays.<br/>If a shipment is returned due to an incorrect address, refusal to accept, or failed delivery attempts, re-shipping charges may apply.<br/>AstroAura.market will not be liable for delays arising from natural disasters, customs delays, political unrest, or courier service disruptions.<br/></p><h2>Need Help?</h2><p>For any shipping-related queries or support with your order, please contact our customer service team:</p><p>📧 Email: vikram@astroaura.ai<br/>📞 Phone: +91-9910602567</p><p>We are here to ensure your order reaches you safely, securely, and on time.</p>"
          }
        }
